            <title>[IGNITE-17815] Java thin: Exception in ClientRetryPolicy is swallowed, operation hangs</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17815</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When &lt;b&gt;ClientRetryPolicy&lt;/b&gt; implementation throws an exception, it is not passed anywhere, and the operation hangs forever (future never completes).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
